## Risks and Mitigations

## Risk 1 — Wrong Variant Prescribed

### Mitigation

Require explicit variant selection and persist only `medicine_form_id`.

## Risk 2 — Over-Automation of Clinical Choices

### Mitigation

Keep SIG fields editable and require clinician confirmation in this phase.

## Risk 3 — Context Misinterpreted as Recommendation

### Mitigation

Display discovery context as informational metadata only, not as an enforced prescribing recommendation.

## Risk 4 — Hidden Legacy Dependencies

### Mitigation

Verify prescription history, worklist, and dispensing do not fall back to deprecated medicine columns.

## Risk 5 — Variant Becomes Stale During Handoff

### Mitigation

Validate selected `medicine_form_id` again at save time.

